# Desktop: pattern Boxes, wallpaper winlogo.bmp (tab lands on the checked Tile), OK: the desktop shows
# the tiled wallpaper. Same keys as arch311-ref/scn/desktop-pattern.scn.
# Desktop is the third icon here (Ports, Mouse, Desktop, ...); real 3.11 has it fifth (index 4).
# Run: ARCH311_REF=<rig> ARCH311_REF_INI=1 tools/run-cp-test.sh apps/control/tests/desktop-pattern.w16 OUT
sleep 600
key right
key right
key enter
sleep 600
shot shots/01-desktop.png
key down
key down
sleep 200
shot shots/02-boxes.png
key tab
key tab
key tab
key tab
key tab
sleep 200
shotcaret shots/03-wallpaper.png
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
sleep 200
shotcaret shots/04-winlogo.png
key tab
sleep 200
shot shots/05-tile.png
key space
key enter
sleep 800
shot shots/06-ok.png
quit
